Actually, it's the other way around... There is a flag HProtection,
and a counter u.ublessed.  When a gremlin steals your protection,
u.ublessed is set to 0, but HProtection is not changed.  This way, you
only get the 2-4 points of protection from your first 400*XL donation
to a priest, not just when u.ublessed = 0.

